    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>#Zombie</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEW ZOMBIE GAMEMODE JUST RELEASE !<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/1f33c77b60eaba3390a4574afbe942ec.poster.avif?t=1750962796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/1f33c77b60eaba3390a4574afbe942ec.webm?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/1f33c77b60eaba3390a4574afbe942ec.mp4?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hi everyone, here\u2019s the first teaser for Bodycam Zombie, coming this Halloween! <i>Welcome to the Saint Sauveur Asylum...</i> Our mission is to deliver the most realistic, terrifying, and immersive round-based zombie experience ever created, where every decision could be your last. Only the strongest team or the bravest solo player will survive the night.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>BODYCAM</strong> is an ultra-realistic multiplayer first-person shooter game built using the latest technologies from the next-generation Unreal Engine 5 game engine. Developed by two French video game enthusiasts aged 17 and 20, the game was designed to push the boundaries of realism and photorealism: a truly revolutionary experience for the genre.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/6fd1c77819008f8379b2451dd00d22cd.poster.avif?t=1750962796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/6fd1c77819008f8379b2451dd00d22cd.webm?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/6fd1c77819008f8379b2451dd00d22cd.mp4?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With the capabilities and technologies available through Unreal Engine 5, players will experience a next-generation gaming experience that showcases the future of realistic video games - stunning graphics, immersive sound effects, as well as a revolutionary shooting and movement experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/20fce8a16bb2900dc1f296ecb8d6b418.poster.avif?t=1750962796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/20fce8a16bb2900dc1f296ecb8d6b418.webm?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/20fce8a16bb2900dc1f296ecb8d6b418.mp4?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare to dive into intense combat phases with your teammates, plan strategies to triumph over your opponents using your equipment. Ultra-detailed environments allow for total immersion and in-depth tactics. Enjoy classic game modes like Deathmatch or Team Deathmatch, and also a brand new Body Bomb mode designed for competition. Cooperation and communication with your teammates will be essential to win!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/a1f185ac83a46447874de77e19d4e98f.poster.avif?t=1750962796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/a1f185ac83a46447874de77e19d4e98f.webm?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/a1f185ac83a46447874de77e19d4e98f.mp4?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>We strongly recommend that you refer to the required specifications to ensure that your computer meets the minimum requirements to take full advantage of BODYCAM's full potential.<br><br>BODYCAM will be released in beta state soon and will be regularly updated thanks to feedback from the community on our social networks, with multiple correction and content patches.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>BODYCAM</strong> is an ultra-realistic multiplayer first-person shooter game built using the latest technologies from the next-generation Unreal Engine 5 game engine. Developed by two French video game enthusiasts aged 17 and 20, the game was designed to push the boundaries of realism and photorealism: a truly revolutionary experience for the genre.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/6fd1c77819008f8379b2451dd00d22cd.poster.avif?t=1750962796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/6fd1c77819008f8379b2451dd00d22cd.webm?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/6fd1c77819008f8379b2451dd00d22cd.mp4?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With the capabilities and technologies available through Unreal Engine 5, players will experience a next-generation gaming experience that showcases the future of realistic video games - stunning graphics, immersive sound effects, as well as a revolutionary shooting and movement experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/20fce8a16bb2900dc1f296ecb8d6b418.poster.avif?t=1750962796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/20fce8a16bb2900dc1f296ecb8d6b418.webm?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/20fce8a16bb2900dc1f296ecb8d6b418.mp4?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare to dive into intense combat phases with your teammates, plan strategies to triumph over your opponents using your equipment. Ultra-detailed environments allow for total immersion and in-depth tactics. Enjoy classic game modes like Deathmatch or Team Deathmatch, and also a brand new Body Bomb mode designed for competition. Cooperation and communication with your teammates will be essential to win!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/a1f185ac83a46447874de77e19d4e98f.poster.avif?t=1750962796\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/a1f185ac83a46447874de77e19d4e98f.webm?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/extras/a1f185ac83a46447874de77e19d4e98f.mp4?t=1750962796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>We strongly recommend that you refer to the required specifications to ensure that your computer meets the minimum requirements to take full advantage of BODYCAM's full potential.<br><br>BODYCAM will be released in beta state soon and will be regularly updated thanks to feedback from the community on our social networks, with multiple correction and content patches.",
    "short_description": "Bodycam is the first ultra-realistic multiplayer, first-person shooter game made using the latest technologies of the next-gen game engine Unreal Engine 5. Get ready to dive into fast-paced Bodycam actions, where every bullet counts and every choice can decide over the victory or loss of your team.",
